==Trivia==
*Rattata is one of seven Pokémon in the {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} expansion featured in the "Touring the Kanto Region" [[Genetic Apex (TCG Pocket)#Themed Collections|Themed Collection]], in which all of the cards show various elements of the [[Kanto]] region. This card's illustration features [[Pallet Town]], as depicted in {{game|FireRed and LeafGreen|s}}.
*This card is almost identical to {{TCG ID|Undaunted|Rattata|64}} from the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]'s {{TCG|Undaunted}} expansion, except for the {{TCG|Weakness}} modifier.

===Origin===
*'''Gnaw''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Base Set|Pikachu|58}} from the {{TCG|Base Set}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Sun}}.

